**Current phase: in preparation.** Theme, call for papers and registration will be announced here.

## About the congress

Every five years, the IVG brings together Germanists from all over the world in a large congress, with hundreds of panels on literature, language, translation and German teaching. The last edition was in Graz, Austria, in 2025.

The next one will be in Rio de Janeiro, organized by the Brazilian presidency of the IVG and by the Organizing Committee made up of Thiago Viti Mariano, Juliana Pasquarelli Perez and Giovanna Lorena Ribeiro Chaves.

## Want to be notified?

The interest list, to receive the dates, the call for papers and the opening of registration, goes live with the launch of the website.

## Partnerships

Does your institution want to support Rio 2030? [Talk to the Organizing Committee](../contato/).
